libhildonmime
------------------------------------------
Library for activating an application to handle a certain mime type

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libdbus-glib_1-devel-0.108-1
  libdbus1_3-1.16.2-1
  libglib2.0-devel-2.90.1-1
  libglib2.0_0-2.90.1-1
  libhildonmime-devel-4.2.0-1bl3
  libhildonmime0-4.2.0-1bl3
  libintl8-0.26-1
  libxml2_2-2.13.9-3
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gtk-doc-1.37.0-1
  libdbus-glib_1-devel-0.108-1
  libglib2.0-devel-2.90.1-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  libxml2-devel-2.13.9-3
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/maemo-leste/libhildonmime

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/maemo-leste/libhildonmime/archive/refs/tags/4.2.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libhildonmime-4.2.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libhildonmime-4.2.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libhildonmime-4.2.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libhildonmime-4.2.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libhildonmime0-4.2.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libhildonmime-devel-4.2.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libhildonmime)
  /usr/bin/hildon-update-category-database.exe
  /usr/bin/hildon-update-desktop-database.exe
  /usr/share/applications/uri-action-defaults.list
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libhildonmime.README
  /usr/share/doc/libhildonmime/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libhildonmime/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libhildonmime/COPYING.LIB
  /usr/share/doc/libhildonmime/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libhildonmime/LICENSE

(libhildonmime0)
  /usr/bin/cyghildonmime-0.dll

(libhildonmime-devel)
  /usr/include/hildon-mime-patterns.h
  /usr/include/hildon-mime.h
  /usr/include/hildon-uri.h
  /usr/lib/libhildonmime.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libhildonmime.pc

